    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>vaXinator</i> puts you in the microscopic shoes of the <strong>last White Blood Cell</strong>, on a mission to protect the body from a relentless invasion of pathogens. Your goal? <strong>Fend off diseases</strong> and keep the body alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214380/extras/8a9dd4e8e0edc23fada9db1222cdfa0b.avif?t=1731605498\" width=600 height=82 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Game Modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy Mode:</strong> For a more relaxed experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fever Mode:</strong> For those seeking a true test of skill. Think you can survive the heat?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards:</strong> <br>Compete against players worldwide! See how long you can survive and climb to the top in both game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214380/extras/ae0f77c04269c782f6c7a17c54a612a1.avif?t=1731605498\" width=600 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paracetamol Shield:</strong> <br>Protect yourself from damage for a limited time and fend off enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Antibody Booster:</strong> <br>Supercharge your firepower! Increase your shooting speed and unleash a barrage of bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214380/extras/c79e4201eac3c6b5ef77a317d7632675.avif?t=1731605498\" width=600 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wave-Based Combat:</strong> <br>Fight through <strong>endless waves of enemies</strong> with unique attacks and behaviors. Your objective is simple: <strong>survive as long as possible</strong> and rack up points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you hold the line and save the body from infection? Play <i>vaXinator</i> and prove your skills in this action-packed roguelike!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>vaXinator</i> puts you in the microscopic shoes of the <strong>last White Blood Cell</strong>, on a mission to protect the body from a relentless invasion of pathogens. Your goal? <strong>Fend off diseases</strong> and keep the body alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214380/extras/8a9dd4e8e0edc23fada9db1222cdfa0b.avif?t=1731605498\" width=600 height=82 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Game Modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy Mode:</strong> For a more relaxed experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fever Mode:</strong> For those seeking a true test of skill. Think you can survive the heat?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards:</strong> <br>Compete against players worldwide! See how long you can survive and climb to the top in both game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214380/extras/ae0f77c04269c782f6c7a17c54a612a1.avif?t=1731605498\" width=600 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paracetamol Shield:</strong> <br>Protect yourself from damage for a limited time and fend off enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Antibody Booster:</strong> <br>Supercharge your firepower! Increase your shooting speed and unleash a barrage of bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214380/extras/c79e4201eac3c6b5ef77a317d7632675.avif?t=1731605498\" width=600 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wave-Based Combat:</strong> <br>Fight through <strong>endless waves of enemies</strong> with unique attacks and behaviors. Your objective is simple: <strong>survive as long as possible</strong> and rack up points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you hold the line and save the body from infection? Play <i>vaXinator</i> and prove your skills in this action-packed roguelike!</p>",
    "short_description": "Defend the body in vaXinator, a fast-paced action roguelike! As the last white blood cell, unleash powerful abilities and antibodies to fight off waves of infections. Test your reflexes in this microscopic battle for survival. How long can you hold the line?",
